# Optional preset: bsc | eth (RPC_URL / FACTORY override it)
PRESET=bsc
# JSON-RPC endpoint of any EVM chain (BSC, Ethereum, Base, HyperEVM, ...)
RPC_URL=https://bsc-rpc.publicnode.com
# Uniswap-V2-style factory. BSC PancakeSwap V2 / Ethereum Uniswap V2:
FACTORY=0xcA143Ce32Fe78f1f7019d7d551a6402fC5350c73
# FACTORY=0x5C69bEe701ef814a2B6a3EDD4B1652CB9cc5aA6f
POLL_MS=3000
# Optional Telegram notify
TG_BOT_TOKEN=
TG_CHAT_ID=
# Blocks per eth_getLogs request (lower if your RPC says 'limit exceeded')
LOG_RANGE=20
